# Hex Magic: "Until the end of your next turn" (CR 514.2). The Lightning Bolt and the Forest exiled on turn 1 are still playable on turn 3
# (Bot1 plays the Island from exile and casts nothing, as the positive control that the permission is there), but on turn 5, the turn
# after the next one, the permission is gone: the Bolt cannot be cast with Mox Ruby's mana ready, and the Forest cannot be played with the
# land drop open (a Plains from hand is played right after as the control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hex Magic
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Island
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hex Magic.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Exile.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Exile.Forest.Play
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Forest
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Island; Plains
